Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Scheme name: Corduroy Dark
; Scheme system: base16
; Scheme description: A deeper, higher-contrast Corduroy variant with vintage warmth and soft textures.
; Scheme author: taysatte (https://github.com/taysatte)
; Template author: Tinted Theming (https://github.com/tinted-theming)
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\SimonTatham\PuTTY\Sessions\base16-corduroy-dark]

